      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb 3-bedroom duplex to the market, ideally located in the highly sought-after Millrace development in Saggart, Co. Dublin.\nNo. 9 Millrace Park is presented in excellent condition throughout and extends to approx. 94 sq.m of well-proportioned accommodation. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining area to the front, a generous living room to the rear, and a convenient downstairs W.C. Upstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, along with a modern family bathroom.\nFurther enhancing this attractive home are outdoor spaces designed for all-day enjoyment, including a low-maintenance north-facing rear garden and two sunny south-facing balconies accessed from both the kitchen and master bedroom.\nThe location is second to none, with Saggart Village just a short stroll away offering a range of shops, cafés, schools, and everyday amenities. The area is well serviced by Dublin Bus, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, while also benefiting from close proximity to a range of sporting and recreational facilities.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised — contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange an appointment.\n\nFeatures\n- 3 bed, 3 bath\n- Duplex\n- c. 94 sq.m\n- Low maintenance north facing rear garden\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Built c.2006\n- Two sunny south-facing balconies, accessed from both the kitchen and master bedroom\n- Highly sought-after development\n- Ample parking\n- Fantastic location\n- LUAS red line within walking distance\n- N7 & M50 motorways close by\n- Well-presented throughout\n- Early viewing is highly advised\n\nBER Details\nBER: B3\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 XF54\n"
      },
